I'm sorry for spamming you with YAAP, but ascending is still somehow
newsworthy for me. I managed to finish another game in just 2 days of
not so intensive play - this time with orcish chaotic ranger. I have a
question regarding vampire special attack - i encountered a lot of
vampires this time, and they managed to downlevel me several times. I
noticed, that after i regained level my total HP was always lower than
before. Is it a rule, or just coincidence?

Also - is it possible to be very very fast in Nethack? What happens to
Valkyrie, if she manages eat to quantum mechanics being level 6
monster? She will be upgraded to very very fast gaining level 7? Or
she will just stay as fast, as before?

The game below had nothing really special to report about, maybe
except information that i got rid of Scorpius without touching or
firing at him - i put on ring of conflict, and his own centaurs killed
him in few turns. I think he should be stronger than that.

I had a lot of luck again with wishes (wand in Sokoban, Key of
Thievery and decent armor), and decided for fast track - another wand
from castle (magic markers and wands of death), and straight ahead
down and up. I start to understand why people opt for so many
conducts.

And as a side note to self: using ranged weapons is horrible in
Nethack - you have to pick up your arrows all the time, they vanish
way too fast, and you have to switch between your sword and bow. I do
not like it...

all the best
rekrutacja


